<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: Weazel Ratel Power Armor (Type A) -->
  <Weazel_RatelArmorA.label>鼬族蜜獾動力裝甲（A型）</Weazel_RatelArmorA.label>
  <!-- EN: Power armor custom-built for close-quarters combat elites. Its essence-synth reactive armor reduces the damage the wearer takes and raises their pain threshold, letting them hold out longer. When the wearer collapses from pain, the armor's protocol stops the bleeding, heals their wounds and gradually eases the pain. Once the protocol activates, it must be reloaded with Propital-W.\n\nElites who survive close-quarters combat earn respect and fear for having survived at all. Weazel command treats these berserkers as madmen, yet sees them as necessary. However many wounds and missing body parts they carry, those whose skill is recognized are issued Ratel power armor, which guarantees their survival in exchange for a demand: make the melee even more insane. True to its name, the Ratel strips its wearer of fear like a crazed honey badger. Its many built-in survival measures keep the wearer in a state of extreme excitement and moderate stress. For this reason, Ratel wearers are usually considered out of their minds even by Weazel standards, and, drunk on their own strength, they go looking for stronger prey.\n\nThe Ratel comes in Type A and Type B, which differ only in appearance. -->
  <Weazel_RatelArmorA.description>為近身戰菁英量身打造的動力裝甲。精華合成反應裝甲能減少穿戴者受到的傷害並提高疼痛休克閾值，讓穿戴者撐得更久。穿戴者因疼痛倒下時，裝甲內的協定會止血、治療傷口並逐漸緩解疼痛。協定啟動後，必須用Propital-W重新裝填。\n\n在近身戰中存活下來的菁英，光是活著就足以贏得尊敬與恐懼。鼬族指揮部把這些狂戰士當瘋子看待，卻也認為她們不可或缺。無論身上帶著多少傷口與殘缺，只要實力獲得認可，就會配發蜜獾動力裝甲：它保障穿戴者的存活，代價是要求她們把混戰打得更加瘋狂。正如其名，蜜獾會讓穿戴者像一隻發狂的蜜獾般失去恐懼。裝甲內建的各種生存措施，會讓穿戴者維持在極度亢奮與適度壓力的狀態。因此，蜜獾穿戴者即使以鼬族的標準來看通常也不太正常，她們沉醉於自身的力量，四處尋找更強的獵物。\n\n蜜獾分為A型與B型，兩者只有外觀不同。</Weazel_RatelArmorA.description>
